# Evaluation stewardship（evaluator）

Not line-level code review — use **`reviewer`**.

## When to use

### In-flight plan

- Long **Do** phases, milestone checkpoints
- Acceptance criteria completion rate
- Scope drift or blockers → recommend plan split / phase rollback

### Whole project

- Phase boundaries
- Prioritize next design / plan / implementation work
- User asks for status, retrospective

## Skills

| Purpose | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Context | `evaluate-reference` |
| Plan evaluation | `plan-evaluate` |
| Project evaluation | `project-evaluate` |
| Record | `evaluate-record` |
| Role | **`evaluator`** |

## Artifacts

| Type | Location |
|------|----------|
| Reports | `docs/evaluations/`（optional） |
| Plan snapshot | plan PDCA / Progress |
